div.p:
The LMM revealed no significant main effects for treatment or moment across all variables (all P
                         > 0.05). The inclusion of the familiarization session as a covariate adjusted for baseline variance did not reveal significant differences between conditions. Effect sizes for all comparisons were trivial to small (Table 1
                        ).

There was no difference in Jackie performance between the nitrate and placebo conditions (Nitrate: 553.7 ± 18.6 s vs. Placebo: 561.0 ± 18.6 s; P
                         = 0.468; g = 0.27) (Fig. 2
                        ).
